) VALUES (
    'biathlon-world-cup-history',
    '{"en": "Biathlon World Cup: Building a Global Sport", "de": "Biathlon Weltcup: Aufbau eines globalen Sports", "fr": "Coupe du monde de biathlon : Construire un sport mondial", "it": "Coppa del Mondo di biathlon: Costruire uno sport globale", "es": "Copa del Mundo de biatlón: Construyendo un deporte global", "pt": "Copa do Mundo de biatlo: Construindo um esporte global", "nl": "Biathlon Wereldbeker: Een mondiale sport opbouwen", "ar": "كأس العالم للبياثلون: بناء رياضة عالمية", "ja": "バイアスロン・ワールドカップ：グローバルスポーツの構築", "zh": "Dongji Liangxiang Shijie Bei: Goujian Quanqiu Yundong", "ko": "바이애슬론 월드컵: 글로벌 스포츠 구축"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "The IBU World Cup transformed biathlon from a niche sport into a television phenomenon. Season-long competition across legendary venues captivates millions of viewers worldwide.", "de": "Der IBU Weltcup hat Biathlon von einer Nischensportart in ein Fernsehphänomen verwandelt.", "fr": "La Coupe du monde IBU a transformé le biathlon d''un sport de niche en un phénomène télévisé.", "it": "La Coppa del Mondo IBU ha trasformato il biathlon da sport di nicchia a fenomeno televisivo.", "es": "La Copa del Mundo IBU transformó el biatlón de un deporte de nicho en un fenómeno televisivo.", "pt": "A Copa do Mundo IBU transformou o biatlo de um esporte de nicho em um fenômeno televisivo.", "nl": "De IBU Wereldbeker transformeerde biathlon van een nichesport in een televisiefenomeen.", "ar": "حولت كأس العالم للاتحاد الدولي للبياثلون هذه الرياضة من رياضة متخصصة إلى ظاهرة تلفزيونية", "ja": "IBUワールドカップは、バイアスロンをニッチなスポーツからテレビの現象へと変革しました。", "zh": "IBU Shijie Bei jiang dongji liangxiang cong xiaozhong yundong zhuanbian wei dianshi xianxiang.", "ko": "IBU 월드컵은 바이애슬론을 틈새 스포츠에서 TV 현상으로 변화시켰습니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>The IBU <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">Biathlon</a> World Cup has transformed what was once a military exercise into one of winter sports'' most watched competitions. The season-long circuit across Europe and beyond draws millions of television viewers and passionate live audiences.</p><h2>Origins</h2><p>The Biathlon World Cup began in the 1977-78 season under the governance of what would become the International Biathlon Union (IBU). The early circuit was modest, but it established the framework for season-long competition that would drive the sport''s growth.</p><h2>Television Revolution</h2><p>Biathlon''s transformation came through television. The combination of skiing and shooting proved unexpectedly compelling viewing. Cameras could follow athletes through the course, then capture the drama of the shooting range where races were often decided.</p><p>German broadcasters, in particular, embraced biathlon, helping build massive domestic audiences. ARD and ZDF coverage made biathlon household viewing during winter months.</p><h2>The Venues</h2><p>Classic venues define the World Cup circuit:</p><p><a href=\"/anterselva-venue-guide/\">Anterselva/Antholz</a> in Italy offers one of the sport''s most beautiful settings in the South Tyrol Alps. The high altitude tests athlete conditioning.</p><p><a href=\"/ruhpolding-venue-guide/\">Ruhpolding</a> in Germany draws the sport''s largest crowds. German passion for biathlon fills the stadium for every race.</p><p><a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> in Norway hosts the World Cup finals, bringing Nordic skiing tradition to the season''s climax.</p><p>Oberhof, Östersund, and Pokljuka complete the traditional core of the circuit.</p><h2>Legends of the Sport</h2><p>Norway''s Ole Einar Bjørndalen became biathlon''s most decorated athlete, winning 20 World Championship golds. His longevity and success elevated the sport''s profile globally.</p><p>France''s Martin Fourcade dominated the 2010s, winning seven consecutive overall titles. His rivalry with other top athletes created compelling season-long narratives.</p><p>Germany''s Magdalena Neuner and Laura Dahlmeier brought new audiences to women''s biathlon through their excellence and personality.</p><h2>Modern Era</h2><p>Today''s World Cup features <a href=\"/johannes-boe-profile/\">Johannes Thingnes Bø</a> as the dominant force. His battle with athletes like <a href=\"/emilien-jacquelin-profile/\">Emilien Jacquelin</a> and <a href=\"/sebastian-samuelsson-profile/\">Sebastian Samuelsson</a> continues biathlon''s tradition of compelling rivalries.</p><p>In women''s racing, <a href=\"/lisa-vittozzi-profile/\">Lisa Vittozzi</a>, <a href=\"/dorothea-wierer-profile/\">Dorothea Wierer</a>, and <a href=\"/elvira-oeberg-profile/\">Elvira Öberg</a> lead a competitive field.</p><h2>Race Formats</h2><p>The World Cup features multiple formats: individual races with time penalties for missed shots, sprints, pursuit races where athletes start with gaps from previous results, mass starts, and relays. This variety ensures fans never see the same race twice.</p><h2>Global Expansion</h2><p>While Europe remains biathlon''s heartland, the sport has expanded. Asian venues have hosted events, and athletes from North America and other regions have become increasingly competitive.</p><p>The World Cup has achieved what it set out to do: create a compelling season-long competition that showcases biathlon''s unique blend of endurance and precision.</p>", "de": "<p>Der IBU <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">Biathlon</a> Weltcup hat eine einst militärische Übung in eine der meistgesehenen Wintersporthveranstaltungen verwandelt.</p><h2>Ursprünge</h2><p>Der Biathlon-Weltcup begann in der Saison 1977-78.</p><h2>Fernsehrevolution</h2><p>Biathlons Transformation kam durch das Fernsehen. Deutsche Sender übernahmen den Biathlon und halfen, massive Inlandspublikum aufzubauen.</p><h2>Die Austragungsorte</h2><p><a href=\"/anterselva-venue-guide/\">Antholz</a> bietet eine der schönsten Kulissen. <a href=\"/ruhpolding-venue-guide/\">Ruhpolding</a> zieht die größten Menschenmassen an.</p><h2>Moderne Ära</h2><p>Heute ist <a href=\"/johannes-boe-profile/\">Johannes Thingnes Bø</a> die dominierende Kraft.</p>", "fr": "<p>La Coupe du monde IBU de <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biathlon</a> a transformé ce qui était autrefois un exercice militaire en l''une des compétitions les plus regardées des sports d''hiver.</p><h2>Origines</h2><p>La Coupe du monde de biathlon a commencé lors de la saison 1977-78.</p><h2>Révolution télévisée</h2><p>La transformation du biathlon est venue par la télévision.</p><h2>Les sites</h2><p><a href=\"/anterselva-venue-guide/\">Anterselva</a> offre l''un des plus beaux cadres. <a href=\"/ruhpolding-venue-guide/\">Ruhpolding</a> attire les plus grandes foules.</p><h2>Ère moderne</h2><p>Aujourd''hui, <a href=\"/johannes-boe-profile/\">Johannes Thingnes Bø</a> est la force dominante.</p>", "it": "<p>La Coppa del Mondo IBU di <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biathlon</a> ha trasformato quello che era un tempo un esercizio militare in una delle competizioni più seguite degli sport invernali.</p><h2>Origini</h2><p>La Coppa del Mondo di biathlon è iniziata nella stagione 1977-78.</p><h2>Rivoluzione televisiva</h2><p>La trasformazione del biathlon è avvenuta attraverso la televisione.</p><h2>Le sedi</h2><p><a href=\"/anterselva-venue-guide/\">Anterselva</a> offre uno degli scenari più belli. <a href=\"/ruhpolding-venue-guide/\">Ruhpolding</a> attira le folle più grandi.</p><h2>Era moderna</h2><p>Oggi <a href=\"/johannes-boe-profile/\">Johannes Thingnes Bø</a> è la forza dominante.</p>", "es": "<p>La Copa del Mundo IBU de <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biatlón</a> ha transformado lo que una vez fue un ejercicio militar en una de las competiciones más vistas de los deportes de invierno.</p>", "pt": "<p>A Copa do Mundo IBU de <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biatlo</a> transformou o que era um exercício militar em uma das competições mais assistidas dos esportes de inverno.</p>", "nl": "<p>De IBU <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">Biathlon</a> Wereldbeker heeft wat ooit een militaire oefening was getransformeerd in een van de meest bekeken competities in de wintersport.</p>", "ar": "<p>حولت كأس العالم للاتحاد الدولي لـ<a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">البياثلون</a> ما كان تمريناً عسكرياً إلى واحدة من أكثر المسابقات مشاهدة في الرياضات الشتوية.</p>", "ja": "<p>IBU<a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">バイアスロン</a>ワールドカップは、かつての軍事訓練をウィンタースポーツで最も視聴される競技の一つに変革しました。</p>", "zh": "<p>IBU <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">dongji liangxiang</a> Shijie Bei jiang cengjing de junshi xunlian zhuanbian wei dongji yundong zhong zui shou guanzhu de bisai zhiyi.</p>", "ko": "<p>IBU <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">바이애슬론</a> 월드컵은 한때 군사 훈련이었던 것을 동계 스포츠에서 가장 많이 시청되는 대회 중 하나로 변화시켰습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'historical',
    'BT',
    '{"en": "Biathlon World Cup history - How the IBU circuit transformed biathlon into a television phenomenon with millions of global viewers.", "de": "Biathlon Weltcup Geschichte - Wie der IBU Zirkus Biathlon in ein Fernsehphänomen verwandelte.", "fr": "Histoire de la Coupe du monde de biathlon - Comment le circuit IBU a transformé le biathlon en phénomène télévisé.", "it": "Storia della Coppa del Mondo di biathlon - Come il circuito IBU ha trasformato il biathlon in un fenomeno televisivo.", "es": "Historia de la Copa del Mundo de biatlón - Cómo el circuito IBU transformó el biatlón en un fenómeno televisivo.", "pt": "História da Copa do Mundo de biatlo - Como o circuito IBU transformou o biatlo em um fenômeno televisivo.", "nl": "Biathlon Wereldbeker geschiedenis - Hoe het IBU circuit biathlon transformeerde in een televisiefenomeen.", "ar": "تاريخ كأس العالم للبياثلون - كيف حول دائرة الاتحاد الدولي البياثلون إلى ظاهرة تلفزيونية", "ja": "バイアスロン・ワールドカップの歴史 - IBUサーキットがバイアスロンをテレビ現象に変えた方法", "zh": "Dongji liangxiang Shijie Bei lishi - IBU saishi ruhe jiang dongji liangxiang zhuanbian wei dianshi xianxiang", "ko": "바이애슬론 월드컵 역사 - IBU 서킷이 바이애슬론을 TV 현상으로 변화시킨 방법"}'::jsonb,
    'published',
    NOW(),
    'evergreen'
